✅ Core To-Do List: FastAPI Endpoints for Steraflow

🔹 BigQuery API
	1.	/query/run – Accepts a SQL string or structured query object, returns results
	2.	/query/save – Save custom queries to Firestore with metadata (e.g. for reuse)
	3.	/query/history – Returns list of past queries for a user
	4.	/query/metadata – Exposes schema info for tables used in the app

🔹 Firestore API
	5.	/files/metadata/save – Store metadata (supplier, format, source) for each uploaded file
	6.	/files/metadata/get – Retrieve metadata by file ID or query
	7.	/chat/history/save – Store user-agent chat history
	8.	/chat/history/get – Retrieve past conversations for retrieval
	9.	/agent/context/save – Save structured knowledge for RAG (ex: from quotes)
	10.	/agent/context/get – Retrieve knowledge chunks by tag, product, or time

🔹 Upload API (based on screenshots)
	11.	/upload/link/create – Generate unique upload links (drag-and-drop, S3/Firebase-backed)
	12.	/upload/submit – Sellers can POST files here directly (chatbot link will point here)
	13.	/upload/confirm – Optional: confirm receipt & notify user who sent it
	14.	/upload/list – List all uploaded files per supplier, time, or product

🔹 Knowledgebase & Parsing API
	15.	/parse/email – Parse forwarded emails and extract quote metadata
	16.	/parse/pdf – Extract line items, BOM details, supplier info from PDF
	17.	/parse/chat – Parse WhatsApp or WeChat exports for procurement intel
	18.	/knowledgebase/add – Add structured text to internal KB with tags
	19.	/knowledgebase/query – Retrieve KB entries for agent response

🔹 Agent Interaction API
	20.	/agent/ask – Main endpoint for the user to ask questions (connects to LangChain/OpenAI)
	21.	/agent/followup – Follow-up on same thread with more context
	22.	/agent/actions/run – Trigger specific downstream actions (ex: quote compare, generate summary)

🔹 User & Auth (if needed)
	23.	/user/signup
	24.	/user/login
	25.	/user/preferences/update – Save supplier prefs, notification settings
	26.	/user/invite-supplier – For seller onboarding flow via email/chatbot

